ERROR:ASSIGN_IN_IF: do not use assignment in if condition
#257: FILE: arch/x86/kernel/rtm-locks.c:354:
+	if (likely((status = _xbegin()) == _XBEGIN_STARTED)) {

Do not use assignments in if condition.
Example::

  if ((foo = bar(...)) < BAZ) {

should be written as::

  foo = bar(...);
  if (foo < BAZ) {

